WEBVTT

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.220
Welcome.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.320
We at Kapra Service are always near you.
This is the Kapra head office.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:30.430
It is the head temple of Kapra Service that assists all adventurers.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.090
What kind of service would you like today?

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.130
Oh, ah...

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.600
Sister! Sister Teiling!

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.470
S-Sir, please wait a moment...

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:44.540
What is it, Solin? How rude.
I was with a customer just now.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:48.680
I-I'm sorry. But it's terrible!
It's the Clock Tower!

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:50.300
The Clock Tower?

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.820
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.790
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.290
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:04.790
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:10.600
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.540
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:22.640
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:29.950
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:35.490
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:42.620
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:48.100
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:50.540
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:57.480
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.750
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:03.820
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:06.320
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:10.860
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:16.660
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.570
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:54.500
Hey, what's going on?

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.200
No one knows.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.540
Then someone should stop it.

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:03.880
But when the bell started ringing, monsters filled the clock tower.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:08.880
Let's go.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.420
Too noisy!

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.290
Good, now it's okay!

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:32.300
That way.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:38.550
Takius-<i>san</i>, have you been here before?

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:40.010
Yes, well...

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:55.490
What're these things?!

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:01.600
Thank you, Takius-<i>san.</i>

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.500
They're Deviruchi.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.740
Ow, ow!

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:09.040
Hey, quit it, you!

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.850
Don't get funny!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:22.790
Arrow Shower!

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:30.870
Wha-

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.270
Frost...

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.630
...Diver!

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.280
Look out! Out of the way!

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.270
Huh?!

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:04.960
What's the big idea?!

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:37.230
What's with you guys?!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.430
Heal!

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:42.900
Heal! Heal!

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:52.500
Go on ahead.

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:03.290
You're not getting past us!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.260
Get on that!

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.170
Wait!

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:23.810
Maaya-<i>chan</i>! Behind you!

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:25.110
Huh?!

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:31.350
Maaya-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:37.890
No! Don't come down!

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:39.090
Huh?

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:40.330
Go without me!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.730
But...

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:44.730
I'll be fine!

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.070
We'll be waiting for you.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.730
Takius-<i>san</i>?!

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:55.480
Now...

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:57.710
Let's get to work!

00:06:57.710 --> 00:06:58.680
Poring!

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.410
Charge!

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:03.020
Arrow!

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.330
Take that!

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:24.200
Wh-What's going on?

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.990
So loud!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.330
This way.

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:00.580
This is it. Once we stop this...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.440
Just hurry, please!

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:07.950
Takius-<i>kun...</i> Takius-<i>kun...</i>

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:09.050
Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:12.190
Takius-<i>kun...</i> Takius-<i>kun...</i>

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:13.150
<i>Sensei</i>!

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:17.120
You mustn't stop it, Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.150
Takius-<i>san</i>! What's wrong?

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:28.700
T-Takius-<i>san</i>! Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.470
<i>Sensei</i>?!

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:34.810
Takius-<i>kun,</i> you should just do as I say.

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:43.180
<i>Sensei</i>! Ah, Zephyrus <i>Sensei.</i>
Why didn't you answer my question?!

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:44.590
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.750
What is it? Is someone there?

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.530
Holy Light!

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:09.240
All is for the sake of securing the ultimate truth.

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:15.920
But <i>Sensei</i>! That man... what that man said... is it true?

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:18.490
You are no more than a pawn!

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:22.860
A throwaway pawn, who gave body and soul to "truth"!

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:25.880
A mere puppet.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.130
Why won't you answer me?!

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:34.960
Yummy!

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:39.610
Takius-<i>kun</i>, from the standpoint of truth,

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:44.480
your words are those of one who is buried in relationships.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:47.950
You are still very young, Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:52.820
Your act of sacrifice will accomplish your goal without fail.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.250
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.700
Cold Bolt!

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:12.600
Yuufa-<i>san</i>!

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.780
Yuufa-<i>san...</i>

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:26.950
Should a girl die as a result of your quest for truth, that is a trifling matter.

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:28.010
That's appalling!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:37.760
Thanks, Falco.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:40.360
Now, then...

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.570
What'll I do?

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.980
Huh? Where am I?

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.910
Was I... saved?!

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:06.280
Huh?

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.700
No! I wasn't saved, after all!

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.610
Huh?

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.390
Roan?

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:43.860
Big Brother Keough!

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.700
Big Brother Keough!

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:15.630
Yuufa! What're you doing?
Playing hide-n-seek?

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:17.200
Huh?

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:19.900
Come, let's go. It's dangerous here.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:22.100
I came to get you.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:24.000
Big Brother?

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.840
That's right.
What're you talking about, Yuufa?

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:30.300
I've always been the only brother you've got.

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:36.050
Bi-Big Brother!
You're the same as always!

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:37.610
Stop, Yuufa!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.020
Big Brother Iruga!

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:51.270
Yo, Iruga. It's been a long time.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:56.570
I've made you worry a lot. I have much to tell you. Won't you come with me?

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:12.150
What's the idea, Iruga? It's me. Keough.

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:14.990
I hope you didn't forget me.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:16.620
Your best friend.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:18.330
I could never forget you.

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:22.790
You're my friend, the only one
I ever trusted with all my heart.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:33.370
That's why I know!
That you're not my friend.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:37.510
Your eyes glow with a darkness that's not Keough.

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:38.980
No way...

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.650
Big Brother?!

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:47.890
Sorry, but you're wrong.

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.690
I'm Yuufa's older brother...

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:53.790
And Iruga, I'm your friend.

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:58.400
It's also true that the flame of darkness burns in my heart.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.970
It was you two that caused it!

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:02.270
Look at this!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.540
No-o-o!!

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:15.020
I'm...

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:16.880
No-o-o!!

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:19.280
Yuufa-<i>san</i>!

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:26.930
Stop, Takius-<i>kun</i>. You must not stop it.

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:32.330
Isn't my word absolute, Takius-<i>kun</i>?

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:39.040
You're a kitty that needs to be trained.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.840
Demon!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:43.330
Don't you... call me that!

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:50.880
My name is Jirtas.
Call me Jirtas, Kitty.

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.030
Huh?

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:07.570
What's that?

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:09.370
Ohh.

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:12.930
Crud, crud, crud, crud!

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:27.450
Wh-Who the heck are you?!

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:29.790
Who the heck are you to be so rude?

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:33.130
Call me "Beautiful Big Sister."

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:36.290
Hey, no, stay away! Stay away, you!

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:40.940
Hmmm. Really? Guess I'll go, then.

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:44.970
Yesss?

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.370
Could it be that you want some help?

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:53.850
Then you should say, "Help me."

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:56.550
Okay, bye.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:59.550
Aagh! Wait!

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:01.190
Help me...

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.990
What was that?! I couldn't hear you!

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:04.830
Help me!

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:06.290
"Please."

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:08.000
Please.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:11.030
Well, since you asked nicely,
I'll have to help you.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:14.020
I don't look it, but I'm actually very busy.

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:19.860
There, there, and there.
See? You're free.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:27.250
I'm gonna tell my daddy on you!

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:30.110
What the heck?

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:38.880
There! There! Say something, Kitty!

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:46.130
There, there. Can't you do anything without orders from your <i>Sensei</i>?

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:50.970
Honestly! Humans are such foolish beings.

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:54.740
Bound by values set by themselves, they can't live freely!

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:59.950
And they destroy their own things that they hold dear!

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.480
What do you mean by that?

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:04.610
Who gave you permission to talk?!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:09.790
<i>S-Sensei</i>... what... what should I do?

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:12.690
You're pathetic! Are you still asking?!

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.630
Wha?!

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.700
Ma-<i>chan</i>... is here!

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.910
Poring!

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.440
Maaya-<i>san</i>!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:29.540
What're you lying around for, Taki-

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.620
You...

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:39.390
Huh?

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:42.490
Look! At this scar!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:46.860
Every time this scar hurts,
I'm tortured by the aura of hatred.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:03.210
Does it burn? Are you in pain?

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:06.310
This Hell fire is greater than the pain of death.

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:10.180
It burns not the body, but scorches the soul.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:18.820
Think about it. Why should you alone suffer so? What wrong have you done?

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:24.430
Where are your friends? Your comrades?

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:29.270
After abandoning you, are they sleeping, snug in their beds?

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:34.310
Or are they gorging themselves at a full table?

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:37.710
Iruga... Yuufa would never do that!

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:39.380
I'm not so sure about that.

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:41.880
Wh-What?!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:47.150
Perhaps you think you sacrificed yourself to save your friends.

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:51.860
But your friends will quickly forget you.

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:57.490
In exchange for your eternal pain, your friends will leave and forget you.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:02.630
That will never happen! Never!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:08.010
Is it painful? Excruciating?

00:19:08.010 --> 00:19:12.250
There is only one way to escape the pain.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.080
Would you like to hear it?

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.480
No!

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:19.720
Don't be so stubborn.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:23.520
It is a wonderfully simple thing. Merely hate.

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:25.530
H-Hate, you say?

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:32.170
That's right. Hate your friends, your sister, everything in this world.

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:33.930
Hate everything?

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:37.240
Hatred indeed is the food for your soul.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:41.910
The blue blood that makes your heart beat. The wellspring of your power.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:45.150
Hate, hate, hate...

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:47.250
Hate, hate...

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:49.320
Hate, hate, hate...

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:52.310
Hate, hate, hate!!

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:08.640
I was reborn with the soul of hatred!

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.430
N-No...

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:12.640
Big Brother Iruga...

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.580
I see. Now I understand.

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:17.440
You're not my friend that I knew.

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:20.710
I'll save your soul!

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.110
With your death!

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:25.850
Can you do it?

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:45.770
Big Brother Iruga! Behind you!

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:55.110
Stop it!

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:58.220
Aside, Yuufa.

00:20:58.220 --> 00:21:02.590
Don't forget. I am the only brother you have in this world!

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:08.400
It's no use trying to protect him.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:11.100
My sword is stained with poison.

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:15.770
Poison which no herb can cure!

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:19.270
He'll only rot and die.

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:20.440
No!

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:21.780
Come, Yuufa!

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:27.540
Come with me! This world is filthy.
I'm the only one who can save you!

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:34.310
I see. Then I have no choice...

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:41.190
Bi-Big Brother Keough?

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.070
Die.

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:48.190
Huh?

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round</i> <i>that will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:35.610
<i>This is Binit. The bell in the</i>
<i>Clock Tower continues to chime.</i>

00:23:35.610 --> 00:23:40.180
<i>Roan's new powers surpass</i> <i>even Keough's. However...</i>

00:23:40.180 --> 00:23:42.750
<i>Next time,</i> "Don't Worry, I'm Here."

00:23:42.750 --> 00:23:44.980
<i>We await your next visit.</i>
